I also want to give a quick
shout out to Jelena Ostrovska.

00:09:08.346 --> 00:09:10.673
Thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:09:10.673 --> 00:09:12.924
Your One Word and the fun interview we did

00:09:12.924 --> 00:09:14.488
on your YouTube channel as well.

00:09:14.488 --> 00:09:15.927
I really, really appreciate the support

00:09:15.927 --> 00:09:17.657
and I'm glad you liked the book.

00:09:17.657 --> 00:09:19.037
So thank you guys again for watching.

00:09:19.037 --> 00:09:20.110
I believe in you.

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:21.874
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:09:21.874 --> 00:09:24.080
and whatever your one word is.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.268
Much love.

00:09:25.268 --> 00:09:26.768
I'll see you soon.

